---
permalink: /
layout: default
---
<div class="wrapper">
  <section class="intro">
    <h1 class="intro__title">Hi, I'm {{ site.author }}</h1>
    <p class="intro__tagline">
      Thanks for dropping by! I am a Data Engineer by profession and a Rustacean by interest. My love
      for open source software stems from my belief in the power of openness and collaborative growth.
      You can learn more <a href="/about/">about me</a>. This blog is my little corner of the internet
      where I delve into personal thoughts, share my design and coding principles, and explore a
      variety of topics. If you like my posts and want to stay updated, don&rsquo;t forget to subscribe
      to my <a href="/newsletter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">newsletter</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
  {%- if collections.featuredPosts.size > 0 -%}
  <section class="recent-posts">
    <div class="recent-posts__header">
      <h2>Featured posts</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      {%- for post in collections.featuredPosts -%}
        {% include "components/post-preview.liquid" %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </section>
  {%- endif -%}
  <section class="recent-posts">
    <div class="recent-posts__header">
      <h2>Recent posts</h2>
      <a href="/blog/">View all &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="post-list">
      {%- assign recentPosts = collections.recentPosts | limit: 9 -%}
      {%- for post in recentPosts -%}
        {% include "components/post-preview.liquid" %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
